# ==============================================================================
# NAME: Microsoft Complete Ecosystem Rule-Set (Microsoft.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Covers Microsoft Core, Copilot/AI, Microsoft 365 (Office/OneDrive/
#              Teams/Outlook), Azure, GitHub/VSCode/DevTools, Xbox, LinkedIn & ASN.
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,Microsoft.list,Microsoft,extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

